{#
    Email 04, "Your Lumen Forma is being cast" (Site v4 design, Llunio Email
    Templates/04-in-production.html), sent when the studio marks the order
    In Production (Step 11.2): "Dear {first name}," (the buyer's), "Your
    Lumen Forma {sizes} lamp is now in production. I expect to dispatch it
    on {e.g. Friday 23 October 2026}." and the thanks (wording decided
    9 October 2026, replacing the design's sentence; reworded in the wording
    pass 11.5, 16 October 2026; "lamps … they" for several), the signature,
    01 Progress (the order number and the expected
    dispatch date given in admin), "View your order". "Dorset Studio" for
    "Bournemouth". Laid out by email/_customer.html.twig (the email rules).
#}
{% extends 'email/_customer.html.twig' %}
{% import 'email/_customer.html.twig' as layout %}

{% block title %}Your Lumen Forma is being cast{% endblock %}
{% block preheader %}Order {{ order.orderNumber }}: your {{ order.lampWords.several ? 'lamps are' : 'lamp is' }} now in production in our Dorset Studio.{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
{% set lamps = order.lampWords %}
<p style="{{ body }}">{{ lamps.phrase }} {{ lamps.several ? 'are' : 'is' }} now in production. I expect to dispatch {{ lamps.several ? 'them' : 'it' }} on {{ order.expectedDispatch|date('l j F Y') }}.</p>
<p style="{{ body }}">Thank you for supporting my small studio. Every lamp is made with care, and I can't wait for you to see yours in {{ lamps.several ? 'their' : 'its' }} new home.</p>
{# Signed as the enquiry email (14 October 2026): after the opening, before the details. #}
{{ include('email/_signature.html.twig') }}
{{ layout.section('01', 'Progress') }}
<p style="{{ label }}">Order number</p>
<p style="{{ body }}">{{ order.orderNumber }}</p>
<p style="{{ label }}">Expected dispatch</p>
<p style="{{ body }}" data-email-dispatch>{{ order.expectedDispatch|date('j F Y') }}</p>
<div style="height:8px;line-height:8px;font-size:1px;">&nbsp;</div>
{{ layout.button(url('order_view', { token: order.viewToken }), 'View your order') }}
<div style="height:24px;line-height:24px;font-size:1px;">&nbsp;</div>
<p style="{{ body }}">Reply to this email with any questions.</p>
{% endblock %}
